re of the food after a few hours, we add the variation in temperature to the initial temperature of the food. This gives\n\n$$\n-{4.6}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}+{10.5}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}={5.9}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the temperature of the food after a few hours was ${5.9}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7cb4ef10-bbce-5396-8ba0-9878477b7080"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7cb4ef10-bbce-5396-8ba0-9878477b7080" :answer-field/id #uuid "7cb4ef10-bbce-5396-8ba0-9878477b7080" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3d8e357e-5a75-51e0-975a-7fc507bde8c3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1901839c-9a23-56ef-9d4a-3bdd2ed62c10" "answer-749f8de0-3781-53d1-9cd2-de680738bcf1" "answer-eab31ae8-383b-57dc-9be0-a7aa08b03417" "answer-704b0130-d480-5576-b0cb-9d6d9dcfa6f0" "answer-3d8e357e-5a75-51e0-975a-7fc507bde8c3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1901839c-9a23-56ef-9d4a-3bdd2ed62c10" :answer/id #uuid "1901839c-9a23-56ef-9d4a-3bdd2ed62c10" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{4.4}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-749f8de0-3781-53d1-9cd2-de680738bcf1" :answer/id #uuid "749f8de0-3781-53d1-9cd2-de680738bcf1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{4.6}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-eab31ae8-383b-57dc-9be0-a7aa08b03417" :answer/id #uuid "eab31ae8-383b-57dc-9be0-a7aa08b03417" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{5.4}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-704b0130-d480-5576-b0cb-9d6d9dcfa6f0" :answer/id #uuid "704b0130-d480-5576-b0cb-9d6d9dcfa6f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{5.6}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3d8e357e-5a75-51e0-975a-7fc507bde8c3" :answer/id #uuid "3d8e357e-5a75-51e0-975a-7fc507bde8c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{5.9}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-90030a66-0035-58a4-bb92-3cb6359f5340" :question/id #uuid "90030a66-0035-58a4-bb92-3cb6359f5340" :question/math-academy-id "q-72694" :question/problem "On a certain day in December $2019,$ the temperature in Toronto (Ontario) was $-{7.4}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.$ That same day, the temperature in Seattle (Washington) was ${3.6}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.$ How many degrees higher was Seattle's temperature compared to the temperature in Toronto?" :question/worked-solution "To find how many degrees higher Seattle's temperature was compared to the temperature in Toronto, we must calculate the difference between the temperatures of Seattle and Toronto. This gives\n\n$$\n{3.6}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}-(-{7.4}^{∘}\\,\\text{C})={3.6}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}+{7.4}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}={11.0}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a7673687-dd67-5f57-bad3-833201cdd9a7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a7673687-dd67-5f57-bad3-833201cdd9a7" :answer-field/id #uuid "a7673687-dd67-5f57-bad3-833201cdd9a7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0eb9330e-51f7-5baa-bc8f-ef79483df4a3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1b2918c8-4bdf-5a95-acb9-70cc67316e8b" "answer-be325d58-1b07-53e5-8748-190252047328" "answer-b14aa545-44ff-5d81-889e-7505ab2e4ab8" "answer-0eb9330e-51f7-5baa-bc8f-ef79483df4a3" "answer-14c45106-8c1e-5023-a95b-972641309ade"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1b2918c8-4bdf-5a95-acb9-70cc67316e8b" :answer/id #uuid "1b2918c8-4bdf-5a95-acb9-70cc67316e8b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{10.2}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-be325d58-1b07-53e5-8748-190252047328" :answer/id #uuid "be325d58-1b07-53e5-8748-190252047328" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{10.5}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b14aa545-44ff-5d81-889e-7505ab2e4ab8" :answer/id #uuid "b14aa545-44ff-5d81-889e-7505ab2e4ab8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{10.8}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0eb9330e-51f7-5baa-bc8f-ef79483df4a3" :answer/id #uuid "0eb9330e-51f7-5baa-bc8f-ef79483df4a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{11.0}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-14c45106-8c1e-5023-a95b-972641309ade" :answer/id #uuid "14c45106-8c1e-5023-a95b-972641309ade" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{11.2}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-090aa86c-d0e1-50e4-9098-0d31886c4162" :question/id #uuid "090aa86c-d0e1-50e4-9098-0d31886c4162" :question/math-academy-id "q-72692" :question/problem "The city of Baku, in Azerbaijan, is $91.8$ feet below sea level, while the city of Porto Alegre, in Brazil, is $16.4$ feet above sea level. What is the difference between the elevations of both cities?" :question/worked-solution "To calculate the difference between the elevations of both cities, we must calculate the difference between the city with the highest elevation and the city with the lowest elevation. That is, we must calculate $16.4-(-91.8).$ This gives\n\n$$\n16.4-(-91.8)=16.4+91.8=108.2\\,\\text{ft}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a92dace5-c946-5233-8bc0-9ad6f6dfb1fc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a92dace5-c946-5233-8bc0-9ad6f6dfb1fc" :answer-field/id #uuid "a92dace5-c946-5233-8bc0-9ad6f6dfb1fc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-bde24f01-73b0-50a4-8937-14909cc20bc4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-cfc2827e-aa23-53e9-8ca4-7114a687f2d6" "answer-669006a1-5ff4-5271-9a2c-40bb3c7733d1" "answer-c534b7ed-8b42-5453-a9a1-101070db6ec3" "answer-bde24f01-73b0-50a4-8937-14909cc20bc4" "answer-2edce43b-e6b5-5105-88fc-e87dc8066cde"] :db/ensure [:a